sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Awaiting each save delays the next pull
  accDescr: The consumer pulls item 1, checks cancellation, and waits for its save to fulfill before pulling item 2. The source may buffer internally during the wait.
  participant C as Consumer
  participant S as Source
  C->>S: next()
  S-->>C: item 1, done false
  Note over C: Check signal
  Note over C: await save(item 1)
  Note over S: May buffer internally
  Note over C: Save fulfills
  C->>S: next()
  S-->>C: item 2, done false
